Package: moonrelay
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Surena Karimpour Ghannadi <https://github.com/SurenaSKQ>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libstdc++6 (>= 11), libgtk-3-0, libnss3, libsecret-1-0, libsqlite3-0, libcurl4, libjsoncpp25, libayatana-appindicator3-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Size: 0
Description: A Matrix chat client for professionals.
 Moonrelay is a desktop Matrix client built with Flutter. It supports
 end-to-end encryption via Vodozemac, rich messages (text, image, audio,
 file, video), custom themes, and integration with the Freedesktop
 matrix:// URI scheme.
Homepage: https://github.com/SurenaSKQ/moonrelay
